SEE ALSO
       intro(1), intro(3), errno(3), a.out(5)

BUGS
       There are no process groups, sessions, job control,
       symbolic links, FIFOs, file locking, select, or networking.
       Of V7's calls P32W lacks brk, ftime, chroot, acct, profil,
       phys, lock, mpx and indir; gtty and stty are library
       routines over ioctl. There is no lstat, waitpid, fcntl,
       getgroups or sigaction. Calls 65 and up are not V7's.
